WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.007
[theme music playing]

01:03.229 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:07.984 --> 01:08.902
[exhales]

01:08.985 --> 01:10.487
[mysterious music plays]

01:13.865 --> 01:18.244
"Make sure we're punished right,
you and me." [laughs]

01:19.245 --> 01:21.790
Full 20 years have passed since that day.

01:21.873 --> 01:25.335
And no matter how long I wait,
this punishment won't arrive.

01:25.418 --> 01:28.338
[Sade growls]
You should still be careful.

01:28.421 --> 01:30.089
And watch what you say and do.

01:30.840 --> 01:31.883
Ah, quiet, beast.

01:32.884 --> 01:36.679
Why do I need to be careful?
I'm the all-powerful Genie, am I not?

01:37.931 --> 01:40.016
[Sade] Man, this is so stressful.

01:41.309 --> 01:42.727
[exhales]

01:45.563 --> 01:46.981
[whooshes]

01:53.696 --> 01:55.323
-[camel grunts]
-[Iblis] Hmm?

02:00.036 --> 02:01.663
That smell of clay.

02:14.342 --> 02:16.261
What? You're that…

02:18.638 --> 02:19.556
Did you not die?

02:21.015 --> 02:22.725
-Who are you?
-Huh?

02:22.809 --> 02:25.687
You know the language of Goryeo.
Are you from Goryeo?

02:26.396 --> 02:27.522
Do you not recall?

02:29.023 --> 02:31.484
[sniffs] Definitely you.

02:32.152 --> 02:33.570
You've been alive all this time?

02:34.279 --> 02:36.656
I remember seeing you breathe
your last breath.

02:37.991 --> 02:38.992
I saw it.

02:40.243 --> 02:42.787
-[gasps]
-I recognize those marks, the bites.

02:42.871 --> 02:44.998
-Wow, messy, wasn't it?
-You are rude.

02:48.334 --> 02:50.044
No, just really curious.

02:51.171 --> 02:54.716
The truth is I'm a genie.
We've met before, 20 years ago.

02:55.383 --> 02:58.887
Your final wish was for me to be punished,
but I'm doing pretty well.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.973
Anything?

03:05.852 --> 03:07.145
Come try my dates.

03:07.854 --> 03:09.105
Delicious dates!

03:10.273 --> 03:11.733
-For sale!
-[whooshes]

03:11.816 --> 03:13.276
[yelps, grunts]

03:15.820 --> 03:17.196
[gasps] Oh.

03:17.947 --> 03:19.198
Oh, no. [gasps]

03:20.950 --> 03:22.452
My dates. [pants]

03:23.036 --> 03:24.787
-[crunches]
-[past-life Ka-young gasps]

03:26.205 --> 03:28.583
-[past-life Ka-young] Oh, no.
-Hey, look. Blood.

03:29.208 --> 03:31.294
You take better care of your dates
than yourself.

03:32.128 --> 03:33.463
Horrible thing to say.

03:34.672 --> 03:35.924
I know you tripped me.

03:36.507 --> 03:38.384
Are you going to set this right?

03:40.220 --> 03:41.387
[past-life Ka-young sighs]

03:44.182 --> 03:46.226
Ah, what to do now?

03:48.019 --> 03:49.020
[pants]

03:49.103 --> 03:51.898
Do I still try to corrupt her,
seeing as she's alive?

03:51.981 --> 03:53.858
Oh, goodness. What a waste.

03:57.737 --> 03:59.948
I asked how you were going
to set this right.

04:02.700 --> 04:05.245
[playful music plays]

04:06.162 --> 04:06.996
[coins jingling]

04:08.623 --> 04:11.459
-[gasps]
-Will that do? Should cover it.

04:19.550 --> 04:21.177
[Iblis scoffs, chuckles]

04:29.560 --> 04:31.437
Here. You overpaid.

04:32.563 --> 04:33.606
Enjoy your dates.

04:35.858 --> 04:37.235
Delicious dates!

04:38.444 --> 04:40.863
-Try out my dates!
-Come on, it's plain as day.

04:40.947 --> 04:44.158
Tempting you will be too easy.
You're basically a lost cause.

04:44.742 --> 04:46.244
That means we're almost there.

04:47.078 --> 04:48.871
Try out my delicious dates!

04:49.414 --> 04:51.833
-Try them!
-Wow, this is already fun.

04:52.500 --> 04:54.585
-Where do you live?
-[man] Where is my money?

04:55.962 --> 04:57.046
Someone took my money!

05:05.096 --> 05:06.264
Here.

05:06.931 --> 05:09.559
-Enjoy, my friend.
-[man] Thank you.

05:14.147 --> 05:16.441
Hey, take a look at this.
I got lucky today.

05:16.524 --> 05:18.609
Look, I got some dates for us.

05:19.694 --> 05:20.778
Have some, all right?

05:22.196 --> 05:23.031
Thank you.

05:30.038 --> 05:31.581
[past-life Ka-young] Oh! Be careful.

05:31.664 --> 05:34.459
Stay away, don't touch me!
You're scaring me.

05:34.542 --> 05:35.877
[somber music plays]

05:41.340 --> 05:43.301
Don't listen. Don't listen to that boy.

05:44.969 --> 05:46.262
[sighs] It can't hurt me.

05:48.556 --> 05:49.891
His words can't harm.

05:58.191 --> 06:00.443
[indistinct chatter]

06:21.464 --> 06:22.381
[gasps]

06:22.965 --> 06:23.800
[Iblis] Hmm.

06:24.759 --> 06:25.593
You live here?

06:26.427 --> 06:27.637
[gasps]

06:27.720 --> 06:32.100
What are you doing here? Leave!
I'll get kicked out if they notice you.

06:32.183 --> 06:34.102
Don't worry,
I'm only visible to your eyes.

06:35.812 --> 06:38.147
Also, no one's even looking at you.

06:39.690 --> 06:42.485
[man] My wife bakes better bread
than this. Try some of hers…

06:42.568 --> 06:45.488
-[indistinct chatter]
-[Iblis] You humans are quite shallow.

06:45.571 --> 06:49.617
All it takes is being a tiny bit different
and you're an outcast. Tsk.

06:49.700 --> 06:54.038
Don't disparage. They've given me shelter
and a way to make a living.

06:54.789 --> 06:57.792
[sighs] So, get out of here already
before you're caught.

06:57.875 --> 06:59.293
It's intriguing, that's all.

06:59.877 --> 07:01.963
A human who used
all her wishes for others.

07:02.505 --> 07:05.550
A human who dared to include me
in her last wish.

07:06.717 --> 07:07.760
Huh?

07:09.595 --> 07:10.429
Wow.

07:11.681 --> 07:13.641
So that's how I was punished.

07:13.724 --> 07:15.935
I seriously almost died of boredom

07:16.018 --> 07:18.312
because I had no one to corrupt,
thanks to you.

07:18.396 --> 07:20.273
You're still alive,
so no one can make wishes.

07:20.356 --> 07:23.776
What are you saying? I told you,
I've never made any wishes before.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.529
[sighs] Perfect. Refusing accountability.

07:26.612 --> 07:29.323
Hiding in this foreign land,
with a foreigner's face.

07:30.116 --> 07:33.244
You may appear steadfast,
but you will break eventually.

07:33.327 --> 07:35.204
You'll be corrupt like all the rest.

07:40.334 --> 07:43.004
Is it true? You're only visible
to my eyes, like you said?

07:44.297 --> 07:45.131
Mmm-hmm.

07:46.299 --> 07:47.800
It's one of my magical quirks.

07:50.094 --> 07:53.723
So, why aren't you scared?
Most run for cover when they learn that.

07:55.766 --> 07:58.603
You're a ji-ne, right?
We have them in Goryeo too.

07:59.770 --> 08:03.483
The elders say they are spirits who
grant wishes for their owners with magic.

08:04.066 --> 08:05.693
"Genie," not ji-ne.

08:08.779 --> 08:11.073
Why'd you ask
if I'm only visible to your eyes?

08:13.034 --> 08:14.619
It's a shame that only I can see you.

08:18.331 --> 08:22.251
[chuckles softly] Well, it's just,
your smile is very endearing.

08:25.087 --> 08:25.963
[chuckles softly]

08:26.047 --> 08:27.465
[gentle music plays]

08:35.973 --> 08:36.807
Uh…

08:37.767 --> 08:41.729
"Endearing." That must be
the highest compliment in Goryeo.

08:41.812 --> 08:43.814
[indistinct chatter]

08:47.109 --> 08:48.986
[camel grunting]

09:00.998 --> 09:01.916
Why are we here?

09:03.167 --> 09:04.835
Why in the world do you think we're here?

09:05.753 --> 09:08.297
-I can't travel on foot.
-And where are you traveling?

09:08.381 --> 09:11.300
Back East, to Goryeo.

09:14.679 --> 09:15.930
Are you looking for a camel?

09:17.265 --> 09:18.516
I have excellent camels there.

09:21.602 --> 09:23.104
Just stay here, don't get in the way.

09:28.359 --> 09:30.361
-[past-life Ka-young cries]
-[thug grunts]

09:31.362 --> 09:35.157
-[past-life Ka-young] No! My gold! No! No!
-[thugs grunting]

09:35.241 --> 09:38.077
-[thug 2 grunts]
-[past-life Ka-young yelps, cries]

09:39.161 --> 09:41.706
-[past-life Ka-young groans]
-[thugs laugh, grunt]

09:41.789 --> 09:44.208
[thugs grunting]

09:45.334 --> 09:46.669
[whimpering]

09:48.796 --> 09:49.630
That's enough.

09:51.924 --> 09:54.385
-[whimpers]
-[whooshing]

09:56.262 --> 09:57.096
[groans]

09:58.097 --> 09:58.931
[gasps]

09:59.015 --> 10:00.391
[mysterious music plays]

10:04.604 --> 10:05.563
[grunts, body thuds]

10:05.646 --> 10:07.398
-[thug 1] It's Shaytan!
-[thug 2] Shaytan!

10:07.481 --> 10:08.983
-[thug 1 whimpers]
-[thug 3] Shaytan!

10:09.066 --> 10:11.319
[gasps, breath trembles]

10:17.992 --> 10:18.868
Take it.

10:19.535 --> 10:21.704
[spluttering] Shaytan.

10:22.538 --> 10:24.957
It can't be. You… You're a monster.

10:26.167 --> 10:29.587
[crying] You… you murdered him. Why?

10:32.381 --> 10:33.466
He took your money.

10:34.592 --> 10:37.053
It's my fault. [sniffles]

10:37.136 --> 10:40.264
I know I was blinded by money.
I was greedy.

10:40.348 --> 10:41.682
[sobs, sniffles]

10:41.766 --> 10:45.603
I shouldn't have accepted all those coins
for my dates. I'm a bad person.

10:49.774 --> 10:52.151
I want you to leave my sight.
Don't come back.

10:55.404 --> 10:56.822
[crying]

11:05.581 --> 11:09.835
-[comical music plays]
-[leaves rustling]

11:10.461 --> 11:12.129
[wind gusts]

11:13.255 --> 11:15.174
[funk music plays]

11:17.593 --> 11:19.637
[Iblis grunting]

11:23.766 --> 11:26.352
[fusion Arabic music plays]

11:28.354 --> 11:29.939
[Iblis] Huh? Uh…

11:37.029 --> 11:39.240
The money's been returned
to its original owner.

11:39.907 --> 11:41.742
And that criminal deserved to die.

11:42.535 --> 11:45.746
He hurt a lot of humans, not just you.
I'm sure that they…

11:46.705 --> 11:49.208
would like it… maybe.

11:50.418 --> 11:52.503
What else am I to do
when that's just my method?

11:52.586 --> 11:54.672
You know what I am. A shaytan.

11:57.800 --> 12:01.220
So, when are you heading to Goryeo?

12:03.180 --> 12:06.058
You know, it would be faster
to go through the Gobi Desert.

12:09.645 --> 12:10.479
I could take you.

12:18.737 --> 12:19.613
You could?

12:21.240 --> 12:25.202
-You know the way?
-Roughly. I once blocked the path there.

12:26.871 --> 12:28.247
I can try to find out for real.

12:29.290 --> 12:30.124
Really?

12:32.293 --> 12:35.880
Then, I'll start saving for a camel again.

12:36.464 --> 12:38.424
Thank you, for showing the way.

12:39.633 --> 12:40.468
[chuckles softly]

12:44.263 --> 12:45.764
[chuckles softly]

12:46.390 --> 12:49.143
[gentle music plays]

12:56.442 --> 12:59.445
Why do you live like this anyway?
Don't you get angry?

13:02.031 --> 13:05.701
I was given a second chance at life.
I don't remember dying, though.

13:07.620 --> 13:10.581
These bite marks on my body
are surely connected to it.

13:13.000 --> 13:16.253
I know that I was kept alive
for a reason, though.

13:18.255 --> 13:19.715
And so, I should live with joy.

13:21.759 --> 13:22.635
[chuckles softly]

13:40.236 --> 13:42.905
[gentle music continues]

13:50.871 --> 13:54.124
How foolish. Do you truly believe
there's a right kind of wish?

13:55.000 --> 13:57.378
To gain something,
one has to lose something.

13:57.461 --> 14:00.464
For a person to live, someone's life
must end. That's how it goes.

14:01.507 --> 14:02.550
Sade!

14:02.633 --> 14:04.301
[growling]

14:05.594 --> 14:06.595
-[barking]
-[screaming]

14:22.861 --> 14:23.737
[music fades]

14:25.281 --> 14:26.782
[indistinct chatter]

14:45.092 --> 14:47.303
[coughing]

14:53.058 --> 14:53.893
[coughs]

14:59.940 --> 15:00.774
Khalid.

15:05.571 --> 15:08.866
I bought this from a stall selling linens.

15:09.617 --> 15:13.078
He said this is good for coughs.

15:13.162 --> 15:15.664
You must boil it and drink it,
then you'll be all better.

15:18.375 --> 15:20.711
You take care of the children
and the elderly alike?

15:21.253 --> 15:22.296
Stop that.

15:23.130 --> 15:25.007
Your kind sells out the people
closest to them

15:25.090 --> 15:26.508
and never shows a bit of gratitude.

15:28.677 --> 15:29.803
Isn't that right?

15:30.638 --> 15:33.974
After all, you're half-human
and half-spirit.

15:35.643 --> 15:38.228
You know, his father sings like an angel.

15:38.312 --> 15:39.563
Are you the spirit Shadi's son?

15:40.856 --> 15:44.485
You are sick and weak because
you were cursed with a mortal body.

15:46.153 --> 15:47.404
[suspenseful music plays]

15:48.906 --> 15:49.907
Are you Iblis?

15:50.741 --> 15:54.536
Could you cure this sickness?
You can do anything you desire, can't you?

15:55.829 --> 15:57.748
You are the leader of spirits,
are you not?

15:58.624 --> 15:59.667
I hate being weak.

16:06.966 --> 16:09.176
This body is cursed. Please get me out.

16:09.718 --> 16:13.222
This thread here can bind souls.
I will give it to you in exchange.

16:13.305 --> 16:14.598
An enticing offer.

16:15.849 --> 16:20.312
But I couldn't accept this request,
even if we are kin.

16:21.522 --> 16:22.398
[Iblis] Let's go.

16:50.092 --> 16:51.093
[groans softly]

16:56.473 --> 16:57.975
-[Iblis grunts]
-[gasps, yelps]

16:59.101 --> 17:00.936
-[groans]
-Hey, lie down if you're tired.

17:01.520 --> 17:03.814
-Why are you forcing yourself awake?
-[sighs]

17:03.897 --> 17:06.859
I said to warn me before
you just showed up like this.

17:06.942 --> 17:09.153
How could I have been any clearer?

17:10.112 --> 17:10.946
[sighs]

17:12.114 --> 17:14.491
What are you staying up at night
to make anyway?

17:15.034 --> 17:16.910
-Instead of resting.
-Hanbok.

17:18.787 --> 17:20.914
I'm going to wear it
when we arrive at Goryeo.

17:22.583 --> 17:24.334
But I have to work during the day.

17:27.337 --> 17:29.089
It's so dark, how can you see like this?

17:30.424 --> 17:31.383
Come on.

17:32.384 --> 17:34.386
[captivating music plays]

17:43.270 --> 17:45.022
[past-life Ka-young]
This is where you live?

17:45.564 --> 17:48.442
Wow. It's like a palace.

17:48.525 --> 17:49.985
You've clearly never seen a palace.

17:51.236 --> 17:53.489
Hey. I'm from Gaegyeong.

17:54.073 --> 17:56.700
There are tons of beautiful
and grand palaces there.

17:57.576 --> 18:00.954
Even looking at them from the gates,
even seeing them from far away.

18:03.290 --> 18:06.627
-Even the shape is… You know?
-So you've never been inside.

18:07.753 --> 18:11.673
-Got real close up to one, one time.
-So what else is in your hometown?

18:11.757 --> 18:14.593
[grunts] How different could it be
from here?

18:14.676 --> 18:16.261
[past-life Ka-young] Mmm…

18:19.181 --> 18:22.309
Goryeo has all four seasons.

18:24.186 --> 18:26.105
In summer, it's lovely and warm.

18:27.064 --> 18:28.482
And in autumn, the leaves change.

18:29.942 --> 18:32.903
And in winter, white snow falls.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.908
And when you see
the plum blossoms start to bloom,

18:39.201 --> 18:40.077
spring's arrived.

18:41.245 --> 18:46.708
And once the plum blossoms wither away,
then cherry blossoms grow in their place.

18:48.710 --> 18:49.545
[chuckles softly]

18:51.463 --> 18:53.715
The cherry blossoms are especially pretty.

19:01.723 --> 19:02.558
[chuckles]

19:05.185 --> 19:06.186
[chuckles]

19:10.232 --> 19:12.234
[romantic music plays]

19:23.245 --> 19:25.831
[past-life Ka-young] In Goryeo,
we'd write out our wishes

19:25.914 --> 19:27.916
and send them on boats down the streams.

19:28.959 --> 19:32.921
We believed that if the boats reached
the ocean, they would come true.

19:34.464 --> 19:37.926
Consider this the ocean at night.
Shall I send them out to sea?

19:41.471 --> 19:42.764
Even further.

19:44.641 --> 19:46.977
To the place where the land meets the sky.

19:49.146 --> 19:50.063
Beyond Earth.

19:53.192 --> 19:54.151
To Goryeo.

20:01.241 --> 20:03.243
[romantic music continues]

20:07.539 --> 20:09.666
[Iblis] What did you write
on those boats anyway?

20:11.335 --> 20:13.170
[past-life Ka-young]
No need for you to know.

20:13.253 --> 20:14.087
[Iblis scoffs]

20:15.214 --> 20:16.548
It's almost like…

20:17.507 --> 20:19.760
it's raining stars.

20:21.053 --> 20:22.095
[gasps softly]

20:22.179 --> 20:24.014
[romantic music continues]

20:46.870 --> 20:49.539
PLEASE DO NOT LET THIS WANDERER STARVE

20:52.834 --> 20:55.837
PLEASE DO NOT LET ANYONE FALL VICTIM
TO THIS WANDERER'S STRIKING LOOKS

20:56.588 --> 21:01.510
PLEASE LET ME RETURN TO GORYEO

21:04.846 --> 21:06.848
[all sobbing]

21:13.355 --> 21:16.024
[dramatic choral music plays]

21:23.407 --> 21:27.160
Ejllael! Ejllael has arrived
to take my soul.

21:28.537 --> 21:32.165
[Ejllael] My sacred wings
shall guide you to the afterlife.

21:32.249 --> 21:36.003
I shall go to the afterlife,
with you guiding the way.

21:36.753 --> 21:37.963
Praise Ejllael!

21:38.046 --> 21:41.133
-I'm in your sacred hands!
-Your soul is destined for--

21:41.216 --> 21:42.217
Ouchy! Ow!

21:42.801 --> 21:45.721
[man] My soul is destined
for ouchy, ow!

21:45.804 --> 21:48.265
Ouchy! Ow!

21:48.348 --> 21:49.516
[all wailing]

21:49.599 --> 21:52.728
Hey, before you even take a feather
from my wings, first tell me what's--

21:53.645 --> 21:54.604
What's wrong with you?

21:54.688 --> 21:56.857
[people sobbing]

22:01.153 --> 22:03.947
[Iblis] You, who came from Goryeo,
are enslaved.

22:04.948 --> 22:06.074
Serves you right.

22:07.409 --> 22:10.537
They say, in Goryeo,
there is a ji-ne who also wields magic.

22:11.204 --> 22:13.749
I shall go up against it
once I get to Goryeo.

22:16.043 --> 22:17.294
You wish upon stars.

22:22.174 --> 22:26.553
She spent all her wishes on others.
Now, she makes wishes on mere stars.

22:27.095 --> 22:29.306
To think she made wishes for my sake too.

22:30.390 --> 22:35.228
To think that she was concerned for me,
making sure I was safe and comfortable.

22:35.937 --> 22:37.189
[sweeping music plays]

22:43.820 --> 22:47.074
[Ejllael] What could a mere
moment in time mean to an eternal life?

22:47.157 --> 22:49.868
All that time, he was connected
to her final wish.

22:51.286 --> 22:52.162
[weapon thuds]

22:52.245 --> 22:54.748
He was more interested in that human
than any other.

22:55.832 --> 22:58.794
He seemed far more excited
figuring out how to make her laugh

22:58.877 --> 23:00.128
and what to feed her…

23:01.171 --> 23:03.882
than he was in figuring out
his plan for spreading evil

23:04.466 --> 23:05.884
and corrupting the world.

23:05.967 --> 23:07.302
[sighs] I know.

23:08.178 --> 23:09.137
[cries softly]

23:10.764 --> 23:12.349
It's so tragic, Master.

23:13.517 --> 23:16.353
[Irem sobbing]

23:17.938 --> 23:18.772
[sighs]

23:19.981 --> 23:23.610
Look, I'm over here complaining about
how much of a fool Iblis is.

23:23.693 --> 23:25.737
But I can't complain
if you're just crying.

23:26.321 --> 23:28.865
Apologies, I was too busy crying
to read your lips.

23:28.949 --> 23:30.659
Could you please repeat that, sir?

23:31.243 --> 23:32.119
[sighs]

23:33.537 --> 23:35.413
-Watch me.
-Mmm.

23:35.497 --> 23:36.748
Get out!

23:36.832 --> 23:38.834
[sniffles] Mmm.

23:42.546 --> 23:45.090
[sniffles, cries]

23:48.426 --> 23:49.469
[past-life Ka-young gasps]

23:52.055 --> 23:55.267
[sighs] Try to find some good clams.

23:56.518 --> 23:59.396
Everything you find
is full of these stones.

23:59.479 --> 24:00.981
[groans] Throw it away.

24:01.982 --> 24:03.650
[Iblis chuckles]

24:05.610 --> 24:07.487
[Iblis] Ooh, ow, hot! [sighs]

24:08.613 --> 24:11.783
So, when will you be done
with your clothes? For Goryeo?

24:11.867 --> 24:14.286
I'm having a hard time
finding the right cloth.

24:15.537 --> 24:18.331
-Even so, it's nearly finished.
-Can't you just sew on the road?

24:19.958 --> 24:21.126
Let's leave today.

24:23.920 --> 24:26.339
Really? You mean that? We can go?

24:28.967 --> 24:31.887
-What about your lamp, though?
-Hmm…

24:33.138 --> 24:36.433
I'll just see if I can convince Him
to hurl it with all his might at Goryeo.

24:38.226 --> 24:41.897
You, who are all-knowing,
and strong and great.

24:42.439 --> 24:45.025
And benevolent and noble.

24:46.109 --> 24:51.156
And also merciful, and of course,
wise and, uh, um…

24:51.239 --> 24:53.033
Hmm, and…

24:53.116 --> 24:56.203
-You're desperate and it shows.
-[both laughing]

24:59.080 --> 25:01.082
[chiming]

25:03.460 --> 25:06.129
-Oh? You…
-Hmm?

25:07.339 --> 25:08.548
You're glowing.

25:09.341 --> 25:11.009
A new master? But how?

25:14.429 --> 25:16.056
I'm still tied to your final wish.

25:17.015 --> 25:19.142
No one should be able to conjure me yet.

25:20.143 --> 25:21.353
This is far too soon.

25:21.895 --> 25:24.231
Couldn't this be a good thing
when you think about it?

25:24.856 --> 25:28.693
You were bored without anyone to tempt
with wishes. Isn't that what you said?

25:29.444 --> 25:30.904
[exhales] You're right.

25:32.739 --> 25:34.699
Perfect. I'll just dash over quick.

25:35.909 --> 25:36.993
[whooshes]

25:45.377 --> 25:48.338
-[breathing heavily]
-[wind whooshing]

25:58.598 --> 26:00.934
[man] Finally we meet, Iblis.

26:01.601 --> 26:06.273
You have cursed me to live as
an oppressed Arab migrant for two decades.

26:13.571 --> 26:16.199
[tense music plays]

26:18.243 --> 26:19.953
-[grunts]
-[yelps]

26:20.036 --> 26:21.329
[soft chiming]

26:22.914 --> 26:25.375
[gusting]

26:25.458 --> 26:26.793
-[rumbling]
-[men screaming]

26:29.504 --> 26:31.339
Stop! Cast the bitch aside too!

26:31.423 --> 26:32.590
[men screaming]

26:39.681 --> 26:42.517
[Iblis] Huh, it seems I missed someone.

26:53.236 --> 26:57.032
Please, I want to have more
than anybody else in the realm.

27:00.493 --> 27:02.078
Listen carefully to my first wish.

27:03.038 --> 27:06.833
I wish to have more than even
the wealthiest person in all of Arabia.

27:13.840 --> 27:15.925
I knew you would ask for that.

27:17.761 --> 27:20.388
Your wish has been fulfilled.

27:24.184 --> 27:25.143
[inhales excitedly]

27:25.226 --> 27:26.686
[dramatic music plays]

27:45.580 --> 27:48.041
[people murmuring]

27:50.210 --> 27:51.753
[whooshing]

28:00.553 --> 28:04.641
-What's wrong?
-I have decided on my second wish, Genie.

28:05.725 --> 28:09.396
Kill whoever has sneered at me
or dared to cause me any pain of any kind.

28:11.981 --> 28:13.233
[past-life Ka-young] Shaytan.

28:13.316 --> 28:15.568
It can't be. You… You're a monster.

28:15.652 --> 28:18.613
[crying] You… you murdered him. Why?

28:20.198 --> 28:21.032
[sighs]

28:25.286 --> 28:28.373
Your second wish has been fulfilled.

28:32.544 --> 28:34.087
[indistinct shouting]

28:34.170 --> 28:36.089
[people wailing]

28:37.674 --> 28:39.092
[foreboding music plays]

28:41.886 --> 28:43.388
[people wailing]

28:47.183 --> 28:51.187
[past-life Ka-young] Dates for sale.
Delicious dates.

28:51.271 --> 28:54.524
Come try these delicious dates. Come try.

28:56.401 --> 28:57.235
Try them.

28:58.862 --> 28:59.696
[sighs]

29:01.281 --> 29:03.783
-[sighs heavily]
-[footsteps approaching]

29:08.788 --> 29:10.457
[tense music plays]

29:12.917 --> 29:16.171
Uh… Are… are you…

29:17.422 --> 29:20.842
I got lucky today.
Look, I got some dates for us.

29:20.925 --> 29:22.135
Have some, all right?

29:23.094 --> 29:24.262
Thank you.

29:24.345 --> 29:26.264
Yes. So you do know who I am.

29:27.974 --> 29:30.685
Those dates you gave me
were very delicious.

29:31.603 --> 29:34.856
As thanks, I shall now give you more
than you could possibly imagine.

29:34.939 --> 29:39.277
Clothes, food, houses, servants, jewelry.

29:39.819 --> 29:41.237
Anything you like.

29:44.783 --> 29:46.618
All I want is what I can earn,

29:47.911 --> 29:49.704
but only by my own effort.

29:50.288 --> 29:54.292
I shall be leaving anyway.
I'm planning to return to my country.

29:54.375 --> 29:55.919
[laughs]

29:57.670 --> 30:00.089
You're leaving?
You're too good for my offer?

30:00.673 --> 30:03.343
Now that I am up here,
looking down on you,

30:03.426 --> 30:06.930
I see you're that same slave girl
I bought to feed to my animals.

30:07.013 --> 30:09.933
And even so, you dare think
so highly of yourself?

30:13.394 --> 30:14.395
[exhales angrily]

30:17.232 --> 30:18.358
How does it look?

30:22.570 --> 30:23.863
[Iblis gasps softly]

30:23.947 --> 30:24.989
It's beautiful.

30:25.073 --> 30:26.157
[chuckles softly]

30:27.242 --> 30:28.910
I had finished it a while ago.

30:29.994 --> 30:33.832
However, there was a chance
you wouldn't be able to leave yet.

30:34.874 --> 30:36.084
Because of the wishes.

30:36.626 --> 30:38.670
I don't know the way to Goryeo.
And anyway,

30:39.337 --> 30:41.047
I wouldn't want to go without you.

30:42.257 --> 30:45.009
-[chuckles softly]
-[chiming]

30:46.219 --> 30:47.136
Oh.

30:48.304 --> 30:49.597
Muttalib's final wish.

30:51.057 --> 30:55.186
That means you'll be free after this.
We'll head out tonight.

30:56.229 --> 30:59.065
-For Goryeo.
-Yes. Let's go.

30:59.941 --> 31:02.986
I shall experience
the four seasons of Goryeo.

31:03.653 --> 31:05.488
The bright red leaves, the snowfall,

31:06.698 --> 31:08.241
the cherry and plum blossoms.

31:09.576 --> 31:11.202
If you can't find me, call my name.

31:13.162 --> 31:16.207
You may call me… [enunciating] Iblis.

31:17.876 --> 31:19.002
Iblis.

31:21.754 --> 31:23.172
It's very unique.

31:25.008 --> 31:25.842
Is that good?

31:27.093 --> 31:28.845
If so, yes, it is. [chuckles]

31:29.429 --> 31:30.263
[chuckles softly]

31:35.768 --> 31:38.521
-[gusting]
-[people exclaiming]

31:44.402 --> 31:45.278
[chuckles smugly]

31:45.361 --> 31:46.863
[people murmuring]

31:52.785 --> 31:55.955
Well, then. What is your final wish?

31:56.039 --> 32:00.126
It has dawned on me that I left something
very valuable behind in the desert.

32:00.710 --> 32:04.797
Something so valuable that no amount
of money can possibly obtain it.

32:05.673 --> 32:08.343
My final wish is for her
to submit to me fully.

32:09.552 --> 32:13.389
I wish that this girl remain by my side
for the rest of her life.

32:15.141 --> 32:16.267
[people gasping]

32:20.188 --> 32:21.147
[chiming]

32:22.815 --> 32:25.276
Your last wish has been fulfilled.

32:27.195 --> 32:33.326
Now, I'd like to see this unique woman
that no amount of money may ever buy.

32:33.409 --> 32:35.620
[tense music plays]

32:42.210 --> 32:43.670
[indistinct chatter]

32:46.798 --> 32:48.466
[dramatic music plays]

32:49.217 --> 32:50.218
No, not her.

32:51.761 --> 32:52.637
[soft chiming]

32:55.139 --> 32:56.015
Why you?

32:56.099 --> 32:57.517
[Muttalib] What are you doing here?

32:58.559 --> 33:01.187
I see. You've come crawling back!

33:02.355 --> 33:04.774
I knew no one could ever resist
all my riches.

33:05.525 --> 33:09.028
-Bring her to me! Right now!
-[henchman yells]

33:09.904 --> 33:10.989
[henchmen grunting]

33:11.572 --> 33:12.615
[gasps]

33:13.741 --> 33:15.118
[Muttalib screams]

33:18.329 --> 33:19.998
[Muttalib] Shaytan's shown his face here!

33:20.915 --> 33:22.000
[gasps, yelps]

33:25.086 --> 33:27.463
That man is a shaytan! Seize him!

33:28.881 --> 33:30.591
[gasping]

33:30.675 --> 33:32.051
[pulsating]

33:33.094 --> 33:34.971
[straining]

33:36.681 --> 33:41.227
What is this thing?
Take this off me now! Take it off!

33:43.563 --> 33:44.772
[yells]

33:47.233 --> 33:48.276
[grunts, pants]

33:48.359 --> 33:52.655
You refused my gift to you.
You were convinced the thread was useless.

33:53.197 --> 33:54.824
It has a use, you see.

33:56.868 --> 33:59.120
-A great use.
-[straining]

34:02.623 --> 34:03.958
[Iblis grunts]

34:04.042 --> 34:05.960
[past-life Ka-young whimpering]

34:06.044 --> 34:07.128
[past-life Ka-young yelps]

34:09.172 --> 34:10.131
[grunts]

34:13.051 --> 34:15.636
[yelling]

34:20.016 --> 34:21.309
[Iblis yelling]

34:22.435 --> 34:23.478
Hunbish? Can it be?

34:25.146 --> 34:26.481
[past-life Ka-young gasps]

34:26.564 --> 34:27.690
You made it out alive!

34:27.774 --> 34:29.776
[breathing heavily]

34:31.569 --> 34:34.280
Was that the name of this boy? Hunbish?

34:36.074 --> 34:38.076
[somber music plays]

34:40.995 --> 34:42.622
[past-life Ka-young] Khalid.

34:45.625 --> 34:48.169
[gasps] Are you Khalid?

34:48.252 --> 34:49.837
[ring chiming]

34:54.342 --> 34:56.385
How did you… How is this…

34:56.469 --> 34:57.470
[people gasp]

34:59.263 --> 35:01.349
Look! I've bound the Shaytan!

35:02.141 --> 35:05.019
And this foreign woman, she loves him.

35:05.686 --> 35:06.813
She loves the Shaytan!

35:08.523 --> 35:10.566
What? You came for him?

35:11.317 --> 35:12.819
You didn't come for me!

35:14.612 --> 35:17.198
[grunts] Seize that girl!

35:17.782 --> 35:19.742
[past-life Ka-young whimpering] No!

35:20.368 --> 35:22.245
Let me go! [cries]

35:26.707 --> 35:30.294
I wish that this girl remain by my side
for the rest of her life.

35:33.381 --> 35:35.883
This was the wish. Your wish.

35:37.385 --> 35:39.762
No. [yells]

35:40.805 --> 35:42.014
[grunting]

35:43.766 --> 35:46.352
-I'm coming! Don't worry, I'm coming.
-[crying]

35:46.435 --> 35:48.813
If I can't have her, no one can!

35:49.814 --> 35:51.482
[yells]

35:53.317 --> 35:55.736
[gasps, screams]

35:56.737 --> 35:58.573
No!

36:03.369 --> 36:05.204
-[past-life Ka-young cries out]
-No!

36:05.913 --> 36:07.373
-[Iblis yells]
-[groans]

36:07.456 --> 36:08.791
[blood splatters]

36:11.377 --> 36:12.336
[Iblis straining]

36:14.046 --> 36:15.381
[strains] No.

36:15.464 --> 36:17.341
-[somber music plays]
-[groaning]

36:17.425 --> 36:18.509
[Iblis gasps]

36:19.719 --> 36:21.971
-[past-life Ka-young gasping]
-No. No.

36:23.222 --> 36:24.265
No. Please!

36:28.811 --> 36:30.438
-[yells]
-[people grunting]

36:33.816 --> 36:36.485
[gasping] In Goryeo…

36:38.070 --> 36:40.531
-[coughs, gasps]
-No.

36:45.286 --> 36:47.997
…everybody gets four lives.

36:51.918 --> 36:53.461
Whichever life it is…

36:53.544 --> 36:55.713
[gasping]

36:56.964 --> 37:00.009
come and find me in one of them.

37:01.093 --> 37:03.512
No, no. No, come on. Please.

37:04.055 --> 37:05.473
Not yet. Hold on, I beg you.

37:13.481 --> 37:15.816
Listen now, I am a Genie!

37:16.400 --> 37:19.904
My lamp can grant any human three wishes.

37:19.987 --> 37:24.951
I ask you to grab ahold of the lamp
and claim yourself as my owner.

37:25.034 --> 37:28.663
You must swear, though,
to use the first of your wishes

37:28.746 --> 37:30.831
to save the life of this girl here.

37:32.792 --> 37:33.918
I beg you!

37:35.127 --> 37:38.130
Please! I swear to fulfill

37:39.048 --> 37:41.842
your next three wishes immediately after.

37:41.926 --> 37:43.135
I beg any of you!

37:48.099 --> 37:50.559
[indistinct chatter]

37:51.519 --> 37:54.480
[people exclaiming, murmuring]

37:57.024 --> 37:58.276
[people gasping]

37:59.902 --> 38:01.362
Yes, I will do it, Genie.

38:04.657 --> 38:06.867
I wish that I was
the richest man in Arabia.

38:07.493 --> 38:08.744
Richer than Muttalib!

38:09.829 --> 38:10.663
You…

38:20.548 --> 38:22.383
[tense music plays]

38:22.466 --> 38:23.634
All right, then.

38:24.302 --> 38:28.347
Now, you must use your next wish
to save this girl here.

38:30.349 --> 38:31.183
Do it.

38:31.976 --> 38:32.935
Do it!

38:34.228 --> 38:36.605
Mashallah! I'm so rich now!

38:37.356 --> 38:39.442
-But it's not enough. It's not enough.
-[Iblis] No.

38:39.525 --> 38:41.986
I need more. I need even more riches!

38:43.404 --> 38:45.281
[crying] But, you can't. No.

38:47.074 --> 38:49.285
[gusting]

38:53.998 --> 38:56.959
This is your final wish.

38:58.044 --> 39:01.255
Repeat this. "I wish to save this girl."

39:01.339 --> 39:03.674
[people clamoring]

39:05.217 --> 39:08.721
Do it now! You have to do it! [sobbing]

39:13.392 --> 39:15.561
I wish for more gold, Genie.

39:16.062 --> 39:18.981
Fill this city with
a bounty of gold! [laughs]

39:21.776 --> 39:23.444
[sobbing]

39:23.527 --> 39:25.780
[people clamoring]

39:27.406 --> 39:29.450
No, no. [sobbing]

39:30.368 --> 39:31.369
[groaning weakly]

39:32.745 --> 39:34.413
[sobbing]

39:37.249 --> 39:38.542
[weakly] I'm sorry…

39:41.670 --> 39:44.090
for leaving you all alone.

39:50.179 --> 39:51.263
[exhales]

40:00.398 --> 40:03.692
No, no, no. No! [sobbing]

40:04.902 --> 40:07.696
No! No! [sobbing]

40:07.780 --> 40:09.698
[somber music plays]

40:13.327 --> 40:14.787
[chiming]

40:22.670 --> 40:23.838
[sobs] No.

40:25.005 --> 40:28.634
[sobbing] No. No, no, no.

40:28.717 --> 40:30.386
No, this can't… this can't.

40:31.053 --> 40:34.348
She can't die, she can't die. No!

40:34.432 --> 40:36.517
[Iblis wailing]

40:40.646 --> 40:43.858
[melancholy music plays]

40:47.153 --> 40:48.612
[sobbing]

41:06.547 --> 41:09.133
[breathing heavily]

41:16.765 --> 41:18.767
[dramatic music plays]

41:38.662 --> 41:40.414
[flames roaring]

41:55.221 --> 41:56.680
[ground rumbling]

41:57.681 --> 41:58.516
[yells]

42:03.687 --> 42:04.522
[Iblis grunts]

42:12.404 --> 42:14.198
[Muttalib choking]

42:15.616 --> 42:17.326
[coughing, chokes]

42:18.369 --> 42:20.079
[panting]

42:22.164 --> 42:24.166
[melancholy music plays]

43:01.870 --> 43:04.999
[people clamoring and cheering]

43:25.352 --> 43:26.895
[yells]

43:29.356 --> 43:31.817
[yelling]

43:31.900 --> 43:34.737
[dramatic music plays]

43:37.156 --> 43:39.825
[yelling]

43:39.908 --> 43:41.493
[gusting]

43:45.914 --> 43:47.833
[men screaming]

43:50.336 --> 43:52.212
[laughing]

43:53.756 --> 43:54.715
[blade slices]

44:14.485 --> 44:18.072
[Hunbish] Do you now see
how arrogant you were?

44:20.699 --> 44:21.950
After so long,

44:25.412 --> 44:26.455
that girl's…

44:27.956 --> 44:29.625
final dying wish…

44:32.252 --> 44:33.170
was granted.

44:34.505 --> 44:37.091
[gentle music plays]

44:39.343 --> 44:40.636
This was…

44:42.262 --> 44:43.097
[exhales]

44:44.682 --> 44:45.808
our punishment.

44:48.102 --> 44:52.189
I have lived for so long,
suffering pain in this body.

44:52.773 --> 44:56.735
It does seem, though, that this
eternal body finally released me.

44:56.819 --> 44:58.404
Then, I became a wandering soul.

44:59.154 --> 45:01.573
Until I met her and you.

45:04.118 --> 45:06.120
The punishment has not yet ended.

45:07.121 --> 45:10.916
The two of you are still bound
by three wishes in this life as well.

45:12.084 --> 45:13.836
[breath trembles]

45:15.671 --> 45:16.505
I know.

45:19.133 --> 45:20.134
I caused that too.

45:21.176 --> 45:22.469
[Hunbish] I now return to you,

45:23.971 --> 45:27.057
this tragic and beautiful story,

45:27.141 --> 45:30.644
as punishment
for granting me eternal life.

45:32.062 --> 45:35.607
Born with no grasp of goodness
and being good anyway.

45:35.691 --> 45:39.027
Her last wish, whatever it is,
please protect her.

45:46.743 --> 45:48.871
I offer you my deepest apologies.

45:49.621 --> 45:53.375
You were a noble child,
one of the finest I've known.

45:54.543 --> 45:55.669
May your soul…

45:58.672 --> 45:59.756
find solace.

46:00.841 --> 46:03.844
[gentle music continues]

46:19.234 --> 46:20.068
[sighs deeply]

46:21.862 --> 46:23.280
[breath shuddering]

46:24.740 --> 46:26.909
[sobbing]

46:37.419 --> 46:39.421
[melancholy music plays]

46:52.392 --> 46:54.228
[Iblis crying]

46:54.311 --> 46:55.646
[tears dripping]

46:57.898 --> 46:59.525
[breathing shakily]

47:22.923 --> 47:26.051
[Iblis] Whatever the punishment,
I accept it.

47:28.428 --> 47:30.055
I will take it willingly.

47:31.139 --> 47:32.307
I yearn for it.

47:32.849 --> 47:34.142
[Sade growling]

47:34.226 --> 47:37.896
[Iblis] Impose whatever punishment
you see fit for my arrogance.

47:39.189 --> 47:42.609
I yearn for it, crave it, plead for it.

47:43.235 --> 47:47.030
Remove whatever possessions
you deem too good for me.

47:49.116 --> 47:50.200
I only hope that…

47:52.369 --> 47:53.370
just once.

47:54.371 --> 47:56.290
Please, just once.

47:58.125 --> 47:59.960
I hope to visit a life of hers.

48:02.254 --> 48:06.800
I accept whatever punishment I am due.
Take what you will.

48:09.011 --> 48:10.095
But, please.

48:11.930 --> 48:15.892
Just once, whichever one of her lives
it may be.

48:19.605 --> 48:22.482
Whatever the punishment, I will take it.

48:24.610 --> 48:26.695
I accept my punishment willingly.

48:28.739 --> 48:32.409
Impose whatever punishment
you see fit for my arrogance.

48:33.827 --> 48:37.831
Remove whatever possessions
you deem too good for me.

48:39.166 --> 48:40.459
I yearn for it.

48:47.674 --> 48:50.302
[light chiming]

49:03.357 --> 49:06.193
Wait a minute! Pan-geum is actually where?

49:06.276 --> 49:09.613
She didn't fly anywhere. I'm telling you,
she didn't even go to Hawaii.

49:09.696 --> 49:11.490
-What is she saying?
-[grandma 1] What?

49:11.573 --> 49:12.991
[Heung-rye] Oh, Chang-sik!

49:13.575 --> 49:15.327
You have to come to Pan-geum's house.

49:15.410 --> 49:17.954
Get over here!
I'm telling you, it's crazy!

49:18.038 --> 49:19.206
[winces]

49:19.289 --> 49:21.458
-Everyone, follow me!
-[grandma 2] What is happening?

49:21.541 --> 49:23.919
-[grandma 3] What's going on?
-[grandma 2] Oh, my goodness.

49:24.002 --> 49:25.921
Where are we going?
What's all the hubbub?

49:30.050 --> 49:30.884
[sighs]

49:32.928 --> 49:36.598
[spoon clinking, tapping]

49:40.727 --> 49:43.271
-[assistant 1] Hello, welcome.
-[assistant 2] Welcome.

49:43.980 --> 49:44.815
Grand--

49:45.941 --> 49:47.359
-Mi-ju.
-[sobs]

49:47.859 --> 49:49.695
What is it? You're crying.

49:52.030 --> 49:53.782
-Something wrong?
-[sobbing]

49:57.994 --> 50:01.581
This wretched tooth.
It's a stabbing pain, I can't…

50:01.665 --> 50:03.500
[sobbing]

50:12.676 --> 50:13.719
I'll take a look.

50:17.806 --> 50:18.640
[sighs]

50:20.809 --> 50:21.643
[scoffs]

50:27.315 --> 50:29.109
-[pots crashing]
-[Heung-rye] You evil witch!

50:29.192 --> 50:30.902
-[Min-jae] Ms. Park!
-[yells]

50:30.986 --> 50:32.112
Ms. Park, stop!

50:32.195 --> 50:33.989
Thought you wouldn't be found out?

50:34.072 --> 50:36.032
Oh Pan-geum! Show your face!

50:36.116 --> 50:38.994
If you're so innocent,
show everyone what I saw!

50:39.828 --> 50:41.204
[Bok-ja] Seongnim!

50:41.288 --> 50:42.789
[Chang-sik] Oh, my goodness! Stop!

50:42.873 --> 50:45.083
What pact with the devil
got you looking like that?

50:45.167 --> 50:46.626
How did you get your youth back?

50:46.710 --> 50:49.045
Tell me right now!
Tell us all what you've done!

50:49.129 --> 50:51.673
-[Chang-sik] Ms. Park! She's not home!
-Hey! Get off me!

50:51.757 --> 50:54.009
-Let me go! Get off!
-[Chang-sik] Please, just calm down!

50:54.092 --> 50:55.010
[Min-jae grunts]

50:55.093 --> 50:57.763
Let go! You'll see,
that bitch is playing us!

50:57.846 --> 51:01.516
She bartered with the devil!
She became that young lady! Okay?

51:01.600 --> 51:04.853
Hey! I'd like to be young again too!

51:04.936 --> 51:06.813
-Do me next!
-[Min-jae] No one's getting young.

51:06.897 --> 51:09.483
-Let go! Let go of me, you brat!
-[Jong-heon] It's dangerous.

51:09.566 --> 51:12.194
-Ms. An, stand back. It's dangerous!
-[Bok-ja grunts]

51:12.861 --> 51:15.280
Tell me. Is the Lord even there?

51:16.031 --> 51:19.618
If He is real, He wouldn't let me be
so unhappy.

51:20.494 --> 51:23.580
Why, Lord?
Why do I have to be old? [wails]

51:23.663 --> 51:27.209
-[Chang-sik] Please try to calm down!
-[Heung-rye] When did I get so damn old?

51:27.834 --> 51:30.504
-Oh, Lord!
-[groans]

51:30.587 --> 51:32.339
[panting]

51:33.006 --> 51:34.716
Wait. I know where she is.

51:34.800 --> 51:36.510
-The field!
-[Min-jae] Where are you going?

51:36.593 --> 51:39.012
-[Chang-sik] What now?
-[Min-jae] Ms. Park, stop!

51:39.095 --> 51:41.014
-Please!
-[Chang-sik] Stop her!

51:41.097 --> 51:42.974
-Oh. Don't get out.
-[Chang-sik] Calm down!

51:43.058 --> 51:44.226
Stay and we'll sort this out!

51:44.810 --> 51:47.562
-Let's go! I'll take care of it.
-[Chang-sik] Where's she running to?

51:47.646 --> 51:49.022
I'm positive she's at the field.

51:49.105 --> 51:51.691
-[Chang-sik] You'll hurt yourself!
-[Min-jae] Calm down!

51:51.775 --> 51:53.777
-[Chang-sik] Calm down!
-[Heung-rye] After her!

51:53.860 --> 51:55.320
[Bok-ja] Pan-geum is in Hawaii!

51:56.321 --> 51:58.031
She's not in the onion field!

51:58.114 --> 51:59.157
[Heung-rye] Shut up!

51:59.241 --> 52:00.325
-[tires screech]
-[crashes]

52:00.408 --> 52:01.368
[body thuds]

52:01.451 --> 52:04.204
[all gasping]

52:07.290 --> 52:08.625
[tense music plays]

52:10.710 --> 52:11.837
[Bok-ja gasps]

52:11.920 --> 52:15.257
Seong… Seong… Seongnim.

52:15.340 --> 52:16.716
[gasping]

52:24.140 --> 52:25.725
[breath trembling] Seongnim.

52:25.809 --> 52:28.478
[Mi-ju gasps]

52:30.730 --> 52:32.691
[Min-jae gasps]

52:32.774 --> 52:35.861
You, you lunatic driver! Get out!

52:36.653 --> 52:38.697
-Out of the car!
-[Jong-heon] Get the hell out.

52:39.281 --> 52:40.574
-Get out!
-Get out!

52:40.657 --> 52:43.285
-[Chang-sik] Out of the car, now!
-[Jong-heon] Get out! Hey!

52:43.368 --> 52:44.995
Get out! Get--

52:45.078 --> 52:47.080
[tense music continues]

52:49.207 --> 52:50.292
Is this the station?

52:52.252 --> 52:53.378
I've run someone over.

52:54.379 --> 52:57.382
Ishrun. Remember the way to the house?

52:57.966 --> 52:59.301
I think they're dead.

53:00.343 --> 53:01.344
The location?

53:03.138 --> 53:04.431
Ki Ka-young's property.

53:04.514 --> 53:07.100
[tense music continues]

53:08.393 --> 53:09.686
[Mi-ju gasps]

53:17.027 --> 53:19.029
[dramatic rock fusion music plays]

56:41.314 --> 56:42.816
[music ends]
